{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05508","headline":"长宁公主旧山池 · 丁仙芝","name":"长宁公主旧山池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平阳旧池馆，寂寞使人愁。\n座卷流黄簟，帘垂白玉钩。\n庭闲花自落，门闭水空流。\n追想吹箫处，应随仙鹤游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丁仙芝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05508.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05508","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}